{"id":2291,"date":"2024-01-16T19:31:46","date_gmt":"2024-01-16T14:01:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/?page_id=2291"},"modified":"2024-01-16T20:01:33","modified_gmt":"2024-01-16T14:31:33","slug":"fpo","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/fpo\/","title":{"rendered":"FPO"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"2291\" class=\"elementor elementor-2291\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a8352a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9a8352a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2b0c978 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2b0c978\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"808\" src=\"https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faqs.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-522\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faqs.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faqs-300x126.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faqs-1024x431.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faqs-768x323.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faqs-1536x646.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a4cbd9a e-flex e-con-boxed elementor-invisible e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a4cbd9a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f220728 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f220728\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-86bb391 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"86bb391\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;zoomIn&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FPO<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b77fd6f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b77fd6f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Small-scale farmers have the opportunity to engage with us through our Farmers Producer Organization (FPO) model. We collaborate with FPOs to support the upscaling of livelihoods for small-scale farmers.<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad261c3 e-flex e-con-boxed elementor-invisible e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ad261c3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05d68c5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-accordion\" data-id=\"05d68c5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n        <div class=\"elementskit-accordion accoedion-primary\" id=\"accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card active\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-0-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-fec06d56aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-fec06d56aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-fec06d56aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What is the minimum land requirement?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-fec06d56aa08edc37f29\" class=\" show collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-0-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>The minimum land requirement is 100 acres from the group of farmers or FPO members.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-1-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-16033686aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-16033686aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-16033686aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">How far can these land parcels be?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-16033686aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-1-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>The land parcels should be within a village or block in a radius of 4-5 km.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-2-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-468c54a6aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-468c54a6aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-468c54a6aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What is the minimum period of engagement?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-468c54a6aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-2-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>The engagement period is for 5 years, with a lock-in period of 3 years.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-3-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-17901786aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-17901786aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-17901786aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Who is responsible for providing agricultural machinery, inputs, and equipment for farm operations?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-17901786aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-3-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>The responsibility lies with FPO (operational partner) along with Zetta Farms. Farmers and FPO do not bear any expenses for these.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-4-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-e5fa05d6aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-e5fa05d6aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-e5fa05d6aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Who will pay electricity and water bills on the farm?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-e5fa05d6aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-4-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>Zetta Farms will pay for these bills during the agreement period.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-5-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-20e39766aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-20e39766aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-20e39766aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Who owns the produce and is responsible for its sale?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-20e39766aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-5-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>Zetta Farms owns the produce, and the responsibility for selling it lies with Zetta Farms through FPO.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-6-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-23dee776aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-23dee776aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-23dee776aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What are the benefits for farmers engaging with Zetta Farms through this model?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-23dee776aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-6-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>Farmers receive monthly secured income, health insurance, pension, child education and a share in profits.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-7-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-8196af06aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-8196af06aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-8196af06aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What are the minimum assured returns for participating farmers?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-8196af06aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-7-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <table><tbody><tr><td class=\"s10\">Participating farmers working as Krushiveer receive a fixed amount 96000 (8000*12) and health insurance cover of INR 50,000, ensuring risk-free income.<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-8-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-4c966a06aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-4c966a06aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-4c966a06aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What do farmers get in return for their land?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-4c966a06aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-8-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>Farmers receive an assured profit share as returns for pooling their land with FPO for farming operations.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-9-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-55897826aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-55897826aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-55897826aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">In case of crop failure, what is the farmers&#039; security?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-55897826aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-9-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>Even if the crop fails, farmers receive a fixed income, securing them against any loss, as they haven't invested any money in the farms.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-10-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-58ce58c6aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-58ce58c6aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-58ce58c6aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Is it a buyback model?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-58ce58c6aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-10-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>No, it is not a buyback model; the terms are pre-set and secured through legal agreements.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-11-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-ca716d56aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-ca716d56aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-ca716d56aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What is the security to FPO if the crop fails?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-ca716d56aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-11-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>FPO receives a minimum assured amount in case of crop failure due to weather conditions. Operational mismanagement is not covered.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-12-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-932137d6aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-932137d6aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-932137d6aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Will farmers get returns based on what is grown in their field?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-932137d6aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-12-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>No, returns are calculated on the cumulative produce on the total land parcel, distributed in proportion to the total project size.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-13-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-70fb08a6aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-70fb08a6aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-70fb08a6aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What is the role of FPO in these operations?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-70fb08a6aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-13-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>FPO is the operational partner responsible for cultivating the specific land parcel, managing on-farm activities as guided by Zetta Farm's agronomy team, with all expenses covered by Zetta Farm.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-14-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-4a4f8bc6aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-4a4f8bc6aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-4a4f8bc6aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What is the benefit to FPO in acting as an operational partner?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-4a4f8bc6aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-14-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>FPO receives 5% of the profit share on the total project profit and an additional 1% incentive if 80% of the land area remains associated with Zetta Farms for a lock-in period of 3 years.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-15-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-f9dbf146aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-f9dbf146aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-f9dbf146aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">If the crop fails, who takes responsibility for the failure?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-f9dbf146aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-15-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>The responsibility for crop failure is on Zetta Farms; farmers are secured, and the risk is covered by Zetta Farms.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-16-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-d723c296aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-d723c296aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-d723c296aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Who is responsible for the loss if the land agreement is signed but operations started late, causing the loss of one cropping cycle?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-d723c296aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-16-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>The responsibility for the loss lies with Zetta Farms.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-17-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-68a52d96aa08edc37f29\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-68a52d96aa08edc37f29\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-68a52d96aa08edc37f29\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Who will sign the agreement?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-68a52d96aa08edc37f29\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-17-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa08edc37f29\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>There will be a blanket agreement with FPO and separate agreements with individual farmers through FPO by an annexure.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                                        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>FPO Small-scale farmers have the opportunity to engage with us through our Farmers Producer Organization (FPO) model. We collaborate with FPOs to support the upscaling of livelihoods for small-scale farmers. What is the minimum land requirement? The minimum land requirement is 100 acres from the group of farmers or FPO members. How far can these [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"inline_featured_image":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-2291","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>FPO - ZETTA FARM<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/fpo\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"FPO - ZETTA FARM\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"FPO Small-scale farmers have the opportunity to engage with us through our Farmers Producer Organization (FPO) model. We collaborate with FPOs to support the upscaling of livelihoods for small-scale farmers. What is the minimum land requirement? The minimum land requirement is 100 acres from the group of farmers or FPO members. How far can these [&hellip;]\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/fpo\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"ZETTA FARM\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ZettaFarms\/\" \/>\n<meta prop